     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1: One country to incorporate IDES and embed NDES
Output 2: One digital financial service piloted
Output 3: Two agreements established</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">2021 Update

Output 1: Solomon adopted IDES and published their IDES Report. Established a National E-Commerce Steering Committee and Technical Taskforce.

Output 2: E-police clearance project pioneered in Vanuatu. Feasibility and solution design document developed and published in July 2021. An RFA to develop a website and Android application to issue an electronic PCC was finalized and the implementing consultancy has signed the contract. The ePCC platform and android app are expected to be ready by third quarter of 2022.

Output 3: 2 new e-Commerce projects approved for Fiji under the programme. Cyberfoods and SolvedFiji projects</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
